  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Pakistan Floods Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will deliver integrated life-saving assistance for vulnerable flood affected communities in Pakistan. It will be implemented in three most flood affected districts of Sindh, Punjab and KP provinces focusing on MPCA, Health, WASH and Protection. The Phase-1 runs from September 1st to February 28th; and Phase-2 from March 1st, 2023 to August 31, 2024. The project is being implemented through three different implementing partners-one in each province.</narrative>
  </description>
